  data: {
    LLM: 'First player leads any tile and declares which end is open. Each turn, in counter-clockwise order: play a tile matching the open end (the other end becomes the new open end; if a double is played the open end stays the same) or discard one tile face down. Discarded tiles are kept in front of the player until the end. When all tiles are played or discarded, players expose discards and count pips. Fewest pips wins; that player leads the next deal. Tie for fewest: whoever played earlier in the deal (previous first player has priority, then to the right).',
    Player: 'First player leads any tile and declares which end is open. Each turn, in counter-clockwise order: play a tile matching the open end (the other end becomes the new open end; if a double is played the open end stays the same) or discard one tile face down. Discarded tiles are kept in front of the player until the end. When all tiles are played or discarded, players expose discards and count pips. Fewest pips wins; that player leads the next deal. Tie for fewest: whoever played earlier in the deal (previous first player has priority, then to the right).',
    objective: 'Play tiles matching the single open end of the layout or discard when unable; the player with fewest total pips on discarded tiles wins the deal. Pairs settle by pip difference (stake per pip agreed in advance).',
    gameplay: 'First player leads any tile and declares which end is open. Each turn, in counter-clockwise order: play a tile matching the open end (the other end becomes the new open end; if a double is played the open end stays the same) or discard one tile face down. Discarded tiles are kept in front of the player until the end. When all tiles are played or discarded, players expose discards and count pips. Fewest pips wins; that player leads the next deal. Tie for fewest: whoever played earlier in the deal (previous first player has priority, then to the right).',
    keyRules: [
      '32 Chinese dominoes; single open end; extend in one direction only.',
      'Each turn: play a tile matching the open end or discard one face down.',
      'Winner is the player with fewest pips on discarded tiles; pairs settle by pip difference.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
